Feature: Data Quality Checks for Drug Inventory Management

  Background:
    Given the data quality rules are defined in the DQ_rules_IM sheet of data_quality_mapping.xlsx
    And the drug_inventory_management table is located in agilisium_playground.purgo_playground

  Scenario: Implement Data Quality Checks
    Given I have access to the drug_inventory_management table
    When I apply the data quality rules from the DQ_rules_IM sheet
    Then I should create a data quality dataframe with the following structure:
      | check_name | result | pass_% |

  Scenario: Calculate Pass Percentage
    Given the total number of rows in the drug_inventory_management table
    When I evaluate each data quality rule
    Then I calculate the pass percentage as the number of rows passing the check divided by the total number of rows

  Scenario: Determine Result for Each Check
    Given the evaluation of each data quality rule
    When a rule is applied to the data
    Then the result should be "pass" if all rows meet the rule criteria, otherwise "fail"

  Scenario: Notification of Rule Violations
    Given a data quality rule is violated
    When the result of a check is "fail"
    Then a notification should be sent to the relevant stakeholders

  Scenario: Access and Schema Verification
    Given the need to apply data quality checks
    When accessing the drug_inventory_management table
    Then verify access permissions and obtain the table schema

  Scenario: Ensure Attachment Accessibility
    Given the data quality rules are in the data_quality_mapping.xlsx file
    When accessing the file
    Then ensure it is accessible and verify its contents for accuracy
